flowchart TD
    A[Replay native, archive, and disabled evidence] --> B[Replay approved cleanup evidence]
    B --> C[Verify exact schema-v2 cleanup manifest]
    C --> D[Verify offline remove_and_clean signature]
    D --> E[Replay separately recaptured action-time evidence]
    E --> F{Captured after approval and under five minutes old?}
    F -- No --> X[Fail closed; no receipt]
    F -- Yes --> G{Exact target inventory and state hashes?}
    G -- No --> X
    G -- Yes --> H[Create short-lived canonical preflight receipt]
    H --> I[Independent verify-cleanup-preflight replay]
    I --> J[Operator action still required]

    subgraph Prohibited capabilities
        K[No service stop]
        L[No credential revocation]
        M[No package removal]
        N[No file deletion]
    end

    H -. evidence only .-> K
    H -. evidence only .-> L
    H -. evidence only .-> M
    H -. evidence only .-> N
